{"id":"e_pais","lemma":"épais","pos":"adv","rank":4590,"glosses":["thickly; densely"],"ipa":"/e.pɛ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/0b/Fr-%C3%A9pais.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9pais.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Le mur est épais de deux mètres.","en":"The wall is two meters thick.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"wall"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,null,null,{"g":"metre/meter","l":"mètre"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"next, secondly, second"]]},{"text":"Il y avait un épais brouillard.","en":"There was a thick fog.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"fog, mist"}]},{"text":"Il porte des verres épais.","en":"He wears thick glasses.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},{"g":"glass","l":"verre"},null]},{"text":"J'ai besoin d'un manteau épais.","en":"I need a heavy coat.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"coat"},null]},{"text":"Le sang est plus épais que l'eau.","en":"Blood is thicker than water.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"blood"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"more / no longer"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"water"}]}]}